to keep in mind that being a ray device, the death ray can ricochet off walls.
You wouldn't want to find yourself on the receiving end of such a ray.  So
be careful where you point those things!  (Someone could get hurt! :-)
BTW doesn't the Wiz have some percent chance of resisting the effects of the
ray, or do rays not count for magic resistance?
